	(descr "1-layer planar spiral coil, 8 turns/layer, CW from terminal 1 (viewed from the front). 2-layer board, coil on F.Cu..F.Cu. inner r=1mm, outer r=7.1mm, track=0.5mm, turn gap=0.2mm, via clearance=0.3mm, 1x via 0.6/0.3mm, vias evenly spaced 1/1 turn apart. 8.00 turns total, conductor length 205.3mm. 1oz: R=0.203 ohm, I=1.44 A (external layers), P=0.42 W, L~0.4 uH. Pads 1 and 2 are the coil terminals (net tie).")
